    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IEm">I Em</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be nunna hæmede ⁊ forlygre.] [Ld] Se þe wið nunnan hæme, gehalgodre legerstowe ne sy he wyrðe—buton he gebete—þe ma þe manslaga; þæt ilce we cwædon be æwbrice.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">He who has intercourse with a nun, unless he makes amends, shall not be allowed burial in consecrated grounds any more than a homicide. We have decreed the same with regard to adultery.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Se ðe wið nunnan hæme, gehalgodre legerstowe ne sy he wyrðe—bute he gebete—ðe ma ðe mánslaga; ðæt hylce we cwædon be æwbryce.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
